/-!
# The order of vanishing of a global section is a colength of its evaluation ideal

Let `X` be a decent, locally Noetherian, integral algebraic space over a scheme `S`, let `ℒ` be
an invertible `𝒪_X`-module, let `s ∈ Γ(X, ℒ)` be a nonzero global section and let `Z ⊂ X` be a
prime divisor with generic point `ξ`. Let `(U, u)` be the chosen affine elementary étale
neighbourhood of `ξ` and `A = 𝒪_{U, u}`. This file proves the algebraic half of Stacks 0EQF at
`Z`:

* the generator `s_ξ` of the pullback of `ℒ` to `Spec A` writes the pullback of `s` as
  `a · s_ξ` for an element `a ∈ A`, and the order of vanishing `ord_{Z,ℒ}(s)` of Stacks 0EPR is
  the order of vanishing of `a` in `A`, that is `length_A(A / aA)`;
* the principal ideal `aA` is the extension to `A` of the evaluation ideal of `s` over `U`,
  generated by the values `φ(s|_U)` of the functionals `φ` on `ℒ(U)` — the ideal of the zero
  scheme of Stacks 0845 over `U` once `ℒ` is invertible.

The comparison of the two ideals is the base change of Stacks 03DX: the sections over `Spec A` of
the pullback of the quasi-coherent module `ℒ` are `A ⊗_{𝒪(U)} ℒ(U)`
(`AlgebraicGeometry.Space.bijective_modulePullbackChartBaseChange_of_isQuasicoherentOnSite`). One
inclusion is that every functional on `ℒ(U)` extends to that base change; the other is that `ℒ(U)`
is finitely presented and `A` is flat over `𝒪(U)`, so a functional on the base change is a
combination of extended ones (`Module.FinitePresentation.liftBaseChange_mem_ideal_map_span_dual`).

## Main definitions

* `AlgebraicGeometry.Space.PrimeDivisor.globalSectionStalkCoefficient`: the coefficient `a` of
  the pullback of a global section against the generator `s_ξ`.

## Main results

* `AlgebraicGeometry.Space.PrimeDivisor.genericStalkCoefficient_globalSectionMeromorphic`: the
  coefficient of Stacks 0EPR of the meromorphic section of `s` is the image of `a`.
* `AlgebraicGeometry.Space.PrimeDivisor.orderOfVanishingSection_globalSectionMeromorphic`:
  `ord_{Z,ℒ}(s)` is the order of vanishing of `a` in `A`.
* `AlgebraicGeometry.Space.PrimeDivisor.span_globalSectionStalkCoefficient_eq_map`: `aA` is the
  extension to `A` of the evaluation ideal of `s` over `U`.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 0EPR](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0EPR)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0EQF](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0EQF)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0845](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0845)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 03DX](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/03DX)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

